FluffyFriends Design System (Cursor Guidance)

- This project uses the **Digital Sketchbook** design system defined in:
  - `app/globals.css`
  - `.cursor/rules/fluffyfriends-design-system.mdc`
- Always use **semantic tokens** (e.g. `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `bg-primary`, `border-border`, `bg-card`) instead of hardcoded hex colors.
- Buttons and small surfaces use the shared `Button` component from `components/ui/button.tsx` with `rounded-organic-sm`. **Do not use** `rounded-full` for new UI.
- Cards and larger panels use `rounded-organic`.
- Page layout:
  - `Navbar` at the top, `<main className="min-h-screen bg-background">` in the middle, `Footer` at the bottom.
  - Section padding: `py-14 md:py-20`, container: `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6`.
  - Use `<SketchDivider />` between major sections instead of plain rules.
